#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Collection.</strong> Ọ bụla AAC bụ nke nchịkọta, nke site na nkọwa bụ ndepụta nke AACs nke na-adị n'otu n'ụzọ nkọwa. Nke ahụ pụtara na ọ bụrụ na ịgbanwe usoro metadata nke ukwuu, mgbe ahụ ị ga-emepụta nchịkọta ọhụrụ."

