#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Usoro AACID bụ nke a: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Dịka ọmụmaatụ, otu AACID anyị hapụrụ bụ <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: aha nchịkọta, nke nwere ike ịnwe akwụkwọ ozi ASCII, nọmba, na akara ndọtị (ma ọ bụghị akara ndọtị abụọ)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: ụdị mkpụmkpụ nke ISO 8601, mgbe niile na UTC, dịka ọmụmaatụ <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. A ghaghị ịgbatị nọmba a maka ọ bụla ntọhapụ, agbanyeghị na nkọwa ya pụrụ iche nwere ike ịdị iche na nchịkọta. Anyị na-atụ aro iji oge nchịkọta ma ọ bụ nke ịmepụta ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: njirimara pụrụ iche nke nchịkọta, ma ọ bụrụ na ọ dị, dịka ọmụmaatụ, Z-Library ID. Enwere ike ịhapụ ma ọ bụ belata. A ghaghị ịhapụ ma ọ bụ belata ma ọ bụrụ na AACID ga-agafe mkpụrụedemede 150."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: UUID mana ebelatara na ASCII, dịka ọmụmaatụ iji base57. Anyị na-eji <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> Python library ugbu a."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>AACID range.</strong> Ebe ọ bụ na AACIDs nwere timestamps na-abawanye, anyị nwere ike iji nke ahụ gosipụta nso n'ime nchịkọta pụrụ iche. Anyị na-eji usoro a: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, ebe timestamps bụ ndị gụnyere. Nke a na-adaba na ISO 8601 nkọwa. Nso na-aga n'ihu, na ha nwere ike ịgafe, mana n'ọnọdụ nke ịgafe ga-enwe ndekọ yiri nke ahụ dị ka nke e wepụtara na nchịkọta ahụ (ebe ọ bụ na AACs adịghị agbanwe agbanwe). Enweghị ndekọ efu."

