msgstr "N’ọnọdụ a, ọ bụ metadata nke akwụkwọ dị ka Z-Library kọrọ. Na ọkwa kachasị elu anyị nwere naanị “aacid” na “metadata”, mana enweghị “data_folder”, ebe ọ bụ na enweghị data binary kwekọrọ. AACID nwere “22430000” dị ka ID bụ isi, nke anyị nwere ike ịhụ na e wepụtara ya na “zlibrary_id”. Anyị nwere ike ịtụ anya na AAC ndị ọzọ na nchịkọta a ga-enwe otu nhazi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Ugbu a ka anyị gbaa ọsọ <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Nke a bụ metadata AAC dị obere, agbanyeghị na nnukwu akụkụ nke AAC a dị ebe ọzọ na faịlụ binary! N’ihi ya, anyị nwere “data_folder” oge a, yabụ anyị nwere ike ịtụ anya na data binary kwekọrọ dị na <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. “Metadata” nwere “zlibrary_id”, yabụ anyị nwere ike ijikọ ya na AAC kwekọrọ na nchịkọta “zlib_records”. Anyị nwere ike ijikọ n’ụzọ dị iche iche, dịka ọmụmaatụ site na AACID — ụkpụrụ ahụ anaghị akọwa nke ahụ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Rịba ama na ọ dịghịkwa mkpa ka ubi “metadata” n’onwe ya bụrụ JSON. Ọ nwere ike ịbụ eriri nwere XML ma ọ bụ ụdị data ọ bụla ọzọ. Ị nwere ike ọbụna idobe ozi metadata na blob binary kwekọrọ, dịka ọmụmaatụ ma ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ ọtụtụ data."

