#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Dị ka ọ dị na mbụ, ị nwere ike ịchọta ntọhapụ a na Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kwaga na <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Anyị agaghị ejikọ ya ebe a, mana ị nwere ike ịchọta ya ngwa ngwa."

