#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "N’ihi na anyị nwere ike ịkpọtụrụ onye na-arụ ọrụ ụlọ akwụkwọ ahụ, onye kwetara iziga anyị data niile ozugbo, nke bụ ngwa ngwa karịa. Ọ ka were ihe karịrị ọkara afọ iji nyefee na nhazi data niile, na anyị fọrọ nke nta ka anyị tufuo ya niile n’ihi mmebi diski, nke ga-abụ na anyị ga-amaliteghachi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Ahụmịhe a mere ka anyị kwenyere na ọ dị mkpa ịhapụ data a ngwa ngwa ka o kwere mee, ka e wee nwee ike ịkọ ya ebe niile. Anyị dị naanị otu ma ọ bụ abụọ n’oge na-adịghị mma site na ịla n’iyi nchịkọta a ruo mgbe ebighị ebi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
