#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Agbanyeghị, onye na-arụ ọrụ Libgen.li anaghị eme torrents maka nchịkọta a, ya mere puku dirs nwere ike bụrụ ihe na-adịghị mma, ma nye ụzọ maka “unsorted dirs”. Ndị a bụ <code>/comics0</code> ruo <code>/comics4</code>. Ha niile nwere usoro ngalaba pụrụ iche, nke nwere ike ịghọta maka ịnakọta faịlụ, mana ọ naghị enye ọtụtụ ihe anyị na-aghọta ugbu a. N’ihi na metadata ka na-ezo aka ozugbo na faịlụ ndị a niile, ya mere nhazi nchekwa ha na diski adịghị mkpa n’ezie!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Metadata dị na ụdị nchekwa data MySQL. A pụkwara ibudata ya ozugbo na weebụsaịtị Libgen.li, mana anyị ga-eme ka ọ dị na torrent, tinyere tebụl anyị na hashes MD5 niile."

