#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.intro.text3"
msgstr "<span %(bold)s>Ụlọ ọrụ:</span> anyị na-enye ohere ịnweta nchịkọta anyị ozugbo na ọsọ ọsọ maka onyinye ọkwa ụlọ ọrụ ma ọ bụ maka ịgbanwe nchịkọta ọhụrụ (dịka ọmụmaatụ, nyocha ọhụrụ, datasets OCR’ed, ịkwalite data anyị). <a %(a_contact)s>Kpọtụrụ anyị</a> ma ọ bụrụ na ị bụ nke a. Lee kwa <a %(a_llm)s>peeji LLM anyị</a>."

